---
alwaysApply: false
---

Use SplatTransform to transform a ply file into a sog file.

Check https://github.com/playcanvas/splat-transform for more information.

Use the command like this (-H 1 means include one spherical harmonic, which is plenty for our use case):

```bash
npx -y @playcanvas/splat-transform <input>.ply <output>.sog -H 1
```

In this project splats are stored in `/public/splats`.
